\section{Happy Monthly Diet Tables}
\label{appendix:diettab}
Monthly diet summaries for Happy typical of most
dogs except for Dexter who was not eating the second
snack each day and mostly missed out on copper.
Full data is available online, see Supplemental Information section.
Early 2019 was noted for a brief period of no coughing
with good activity levels. Very little coughing was
observed around the arrival of Daisy. The months prior
to October 2025 were high coughing and some decreasing
activity as noted. The following months were mostly
with the components discussed here as is shown in the table
below.
